            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Steam 上找更多"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loomscreen couldn't copy it into its own storage. Check free space and try again." : {
      "comment" : "Drop failure message when copying the video into app storage failed.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen couldn't copy it into its own storage. Check free space and try again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen no pudo copiarlo a su propio almacenamiento. Comprueba el espacio libre e inténtalo de nuevo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen が自身のストレージにコピーできませんでした。空き容量を確認してもう一度お試しください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 无法将它复制到自己的存储空间。请检查可用空间后重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 無法將它複製到自己的儲存空間。請檢查可用空間後重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loomscreen couldn't use that file as SteamCMD." : {
      "comment" : "Workshop setup error when a manually chosen SteamCMD is refused.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen couldn't use that file as SteamCMD."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen no pudo usar ese archivo como SteamCMD."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "そのファイルは SteamCMD として使用できませんでした。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 无法将该文件用作 SteamCMD。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 無法將該檔案用作 SteamCMD。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loomscreen downloads through SteamCMD, never through a third-party server. You need to own Wallpaper Engine." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen descarga a través de SteamCMD, nunca mediante un servidor de terceros. Necesitas tener Wallpaper Engine."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen は SteamCMD 経由でダウンロードします。第三者のサーバーは使いません。Wallpaper Engine を所有している必要があります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 通过 SteamCMD 下载，不经第三方服务器。需要你拥有 Wallpaper Engine 的授权。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 透過 SteamCMD 下載，不經第三方伺服器。需要你擁有 Wallpaper Engine 的授權。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loomscreen is quitting." : {
      "comment" : "Scene import refused because the app is shutting down.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen is quitting."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen se está cerrando."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen を終了しています。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 正在退出。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 正在結束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loomscreen never asks for Full Disk Access. Library access comes from one folder you pick, stored as a security-scoped bookmark." : {
      "comment" : "Workshop privacy point about file access.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen never asks for Full Disk Access. Library access comes from one folder you pick, stored as a security-scoped bookmark."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen nunca pide «Acceso total al disco». El acceso a la biblioteca de Steam proviene de una carpeta que eliges, guardada como marcador con ámbito de seguridad."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen はフルディスクアクセスを要求しません。Steam ライブラリへのアクセスは、選択した 1 つのフォルダに対するセキュリティスコープ付きブックマークに基づきます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 从不要求完全磁盘访问权限。对 Steam 库的访问仅来自你选择的那一个文件夹，以安全作用域书签的形式保存。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 從不要求「完全取用磁碟」權限。對 Steam 收藏庫的存取僅來自你選擇的那一個資料夾，以安全範圍書籤的形式保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loomscreen never reads your Steam password — only this key, stored locally on this Mac." : {
      "comment" : "Secondary reassurance under the API-key-required state and entry sheet.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen nunca lee tu contraseña de Steam — solo esta clave, almacenada localmente en este Mac."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen が Steam パスワードを読み取ることはありません — このキーだけを、この Mac 上にローカル保存します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 绝不会读取你的 Steam 密码——只读取此密钥，并且只存储在本机。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 絕不會讀取你的 Steam 密碼——只讀取此金鑰，並且只儲存在這台 Mac 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loomscreen reads installed Workshop items directly from the official Steam library after one folder authorization. Authenticated SteamCMD downloads are a separate capability and require Loomscreen's background Steam connector." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen reads installed Workshop items directly from the official Steam library after one folder authorization. Authenticated SteamCMD downloads are a separate capability and require Loomscreen's background Steam connector."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tras autorizar una carpeta, Loomscreen lee los elementos de Workshop instalados directamente desde la biblioteca oficial de Steam. Las descargas autenticadas con SteamCMD son una capacidad aparte y requieren el conector de Steam en segundo plano de Loomscreen."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "フォルダを一度許可すると、Loomscreen はインストール済みのワークショップアイテムを公式 Steam ライブラリから直接読み取ります。認証が必要な SteamCMD ダウンロードは別機能で、Loomscreen のバックグラウンド Steam コネクタが必要です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "授权文件夹一次后，Loomscreen 会直接从官方 Steam 库读取已安装的创意工坊项目。经过身份验证的 SteamCMD 下载是独立功能，需要 Loomscreen 的后台 Steam 连接器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "授權資料夾一次後，Loomscreen 會直接從官方 Steam 收藏庫讀取已安裝的工作坊項目。經過身分驗證的 SteamCMD 下載是獨立功能，需要 Loomscreen 的背景 Steam 連線器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loomscreen won't run a SteamCMD from inside its own container." : {
      "comment" : "Workshop setup error when the chosen SteamCMD sits in the app's own container.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen won't run a SteamCMD from inside its own container."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen no ejecutará un SteamCMD desde su propio contenedor."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen は自身のコンテナ内にある SteamCMD を実行しません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 不会运行位于自身容器内的 SteamCMD。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 不會執行位於自身容器內的 SteamCMD。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loomscreen's Steam connector did not respond, so the signature wasn't checked." : {
      "comment" : "SteamCMD diagnostic (Doctor) probe label or result message.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen's Steam connector did not respond, so the signature wasn't checked."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El conector de Steam de Loomscreen no respondió, así que no se comprobó la firma."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen の Steam コネクタが応答しなかったため、署名を確認できませんでした。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 的 Steam 连接器没有响应，因此未检查签名。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loomscreen 的 Steam 連接器沒有回應，因此未檢查簽章。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loomscreen's Steam connector did not respond." : {
