    "Steam reported \"No Connection\" while downloading this item. Check your network and try again; Steam also answers this way when the account doesn't own Wallpaper Engine." : {
      "comment" : "Workshop download failed: SteamCMD reported No Connection, which is ambiguous between network and ownership.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam respondió \"No Connection\" al descargar este elemento. Comprueba tu red e inténtalo de nuevo; Steam también responde así cuando la cuenta no posee Wallpaper Engine."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このアイテムのダウンロード中に Steam が \"No Connection\" と応答しました。ネットワークを確認してもう一度お試しください。アカウントが Wallpaper Engine を所有していない場合も、Steam は同じ応答を返します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下载此项目时 Steam 返回了“No Connection”。请检查网络后重试；当账户未拥有 Wallpaper Engine 时，Steam 也会这样回应。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下載此項目時 Steam 回傳了「No Connection」。請檢查網路後再試一次；當帳戶未擁有 Wallpaper Engine 時，Steam 也會這樣回應。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam reported that it couldn't connect. If you use a VPN or proxy: SteamCMD reaches Steam directly rather than through the system proxy, so try TUN (enhanced) mode or a direct connection." : {
      "comment" : "Steam sign-in failure when SteamCMD reported it could not open a connection to Steam.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam reported that it couldn't connect. If you use a VPN or proxy: SteamCMD reaches Steam directly rather than through the system proxy, so try TUN (enhanced) mode or a direct connection."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam ha informado de que no ha podido conectar. Si usas una VPN o un proxy: SteamCMD llega a Steam de forma directa, no a través del proxy del sistema, así que prueba el modo TUN (mejorado) o una conexión directa."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam が接続できないと報告しました。VPN やプロキシを使用している場合:SteamCMD はシステムプロキシを経由せず Steam に直接接続するため、TUN(拡張)モードか直接接続をお試しください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 报告无法连接。如果你在使用 VPN 或代理：SteamCMD 会直接连接 Steam，不经过系统代理，可以尝试 TUN（增强）模式或直连。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam 回報無法連線。如果你在使用 VPN 或代理：SteamCMD 會直接連線 Steam，不經過系統代理，可以嘗試 TUN（增強）模式或直連。"
          }
        }
      }
